{"id":2276,"date":"2026-08-27T05:26:33","date_gmt":"2026-08-27T05:26:33","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/?post_type=knowledgebase&#038;p=2276"},"modified":"2026-08-27T05:51:41","modified_gmt":"2026-08-27T05:51:41","slug":"baseline-guides","status":"publish","type":"knowledgebase","link":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/db\/layout-tools\/baseline-guides\/","title":{"rendered":"Baseline Guides"},"content":{"rendered":"<div style=\"color: #2b2b2b;\">\n<h2 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Baseline Guides<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-2283\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/baselineGuides.webp\" alt=\"Baseline Guides\" width=\"186\" height=\"193\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/baselineGuides.webp 884w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/baselineGuides-289x300.webp 289w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/baselineGuides-768x798.webp 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 186px) 100vw, 186px\" \/><\/span><\/h2>\n<p class=\"western\">Baseline Guides overlay evenly spaced horizontal lines across your canvas, mirroring the baseline rhythm of your body text. They work like ruled paper for your document &#8211; helping text in separate text boxes, columns, and layout areas sit on a consistent horizontal baseline across the full page. This technique is a cornerstone of professional editorial and typographic design.<\/p>\n<p class=\"western\">Baseline Guides are non-printing and only visible in the editor &#8211; they never appear in exported or printed output.<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Opening Baseline Guide Settings<\/span><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/GridAndBaselineGuides-1.webp\" alt=\"Open Publisher baseline guides spacing\" \/><\/h3>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Go to <strong>Page Design &gt; Guides &gt; Grid and Baseline Guides<\/strong>.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">The customisation modal opens as a draggable window so it can be moved out of the way while you preview your changes live on the canvas.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">What You Can Customise<\/span><\/h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Baseline spacing &#8211;<\/strong> Set the interval between baseline lines to match the leading (line height) of your body text. When the spacing matches your text&#8217;s line height, text across multiple columns and separate text boxes naturally aligns to the same horizontal rhythm without manual adjustment.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Baseline colour &#8211;<\/strong> Set a colour for the baseline lines independently from the grid guides, so both can be visible at the same time without visual confusion.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p align=\"center\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 6px;\" src=\"https:\/\/github.com\/user-attachments\/assets\/b406fc69-9843-446b-b8e5-15d11a7c365c\" alt=\"Active Baseline\" width=\"1207\" height=\"850\" \/><\/p>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">When to Use Baseline Guides<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-2281\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/WhenToUseBaselineGuides.webp\" alt=\"When to Use Baseline Guides\" width=\"440\" height=\"292\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/WhenToUseBaselineGuides.webp 670w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/WhenToUseBaselineGuides-300x199.webp 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 440px) 100vw, 440px\" \/><\/span><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\">Baseline Guides are most valuable when:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Working with <strong>multi-column layouts<\/strong> where you want body text to align horizontally across adjacent columns.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Designing <strong>newsletters or magazines<\/strong> where consistent text rhythm across the full page is essential.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Placing <strong>text alongside images<\/strong> where you need the text to start and end at the same vertical positions as neighbouring elements.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p align=\"center\">\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Baseline Guides Baseline Guides overlay evenly spaced horizontal lines across your canvas, mirroring the baseline rhythm of your body text. They work like ruled paper for your document &#8211; helping text in separate text boxes, columns, and layout areas sit on a consistent horizontal baseline across the full page. This technique is a cornerstone of [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":2283,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","template":"","knowledgebase_cat":[20],"class_list":["post-2276","knowledgebase","type-knowledgebase","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","knowledgebase_cat-layout-tools"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/2276","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase"}],"about":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/knowledgebase"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=2276"}],"version-history":[{"count":6,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/2276\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":2287,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/2276\/revisions\/2287"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/2283"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=2276"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"knowledgebase_cat","embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase_cat?post=2276"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}